<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>StackGuide — Independent Software Reviews for Freelancers</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Honest, independent software reviews for freelancers and small business owners. No fluff, no sponsored rankings." />
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://stackguide.net/" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    :root {
      --bg: #F8F9FA;
      --surface: #ffffff;
      --border: #E9ECEF;
      --text: #1a1a2e;
      --muted: #6B7280;
      --accent: #2563EB;
      --accent-light: #EFF6FF;
      --accent-border: #BFDBFE;
      --badge-bg: #F1F5F9;
      --badge-text: #475569;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .page { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2.5rem 1.25rem 6rem; }

    /* Header */
    .site-header { margin-bottom: 3rem; padding-bottom: 2rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .site-name { font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
    .site-name span { color: var(--accent); }
    .site-tagline { font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--muted); }

    /* Hero */
    .hero { margin-bottom: 3rem; }
    .eyebrow { font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; }
    .eyebrow::before { content: ''; display: inline-block; width: 18px; height: 2px; background: var(--accent); border-radius: 2px; }
    .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 2.1rem); font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .hero p { font-size: 1rem; color: #4B5563; line-height: 1.7; max-width: 58ch; }

    /* Articles */
    .section-label { font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .article-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; }
    .article-card { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem; text-decoration: none; display: block; transition: border-color 0.15s; }
    .article-card:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }
    .card-eyebrow { font-size: 0.68rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.07em; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
    .card-title { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 0.4rem; line-height: 1.3; }
    .card-desc { font-size: 0.82rem; color: #4B5563; line-height: 1.55; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
    .card-meta { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .meta-tag { background: var(--badge-bg); color: var(--badge-text); border-radius: 4px; padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem; font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 500; }
    .meta-date { font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--muted); }
    .card-arrow { font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent); margin-top: 0.75rem; display: inline-block; }

    /* About strip */
    .about-strip { margin-top: 3rem; padding-top: 2rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .about-strip p { font-size: 0.83rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.65; max-width: 58ch; }
    .about-strip a { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; }
    .about-strip a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

    @media (max-width: 580px) {
      .hero h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<main class="page">

  <header class="site-header">
    <p class="site-name">Stack<span>Guide</span></p>
    <p class="site-tagline">Independent software reviews for freelancers and small businesses</p>
  </header>

  <section class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Software reviews</p>
    <h1>Find the right tools.<br>Without the noise.</h1>
   <p>Honest, independent reviews of invoicing, accounting, and business software. Written for freelancers and small business owners who don't have time to test everything themselves.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <p class="section-label">Latest reviews</p>
    <div class="article-list">

      <a href="/best-invoicing-software-for-freelancers/" class="article-card">
        <p class="card-eyebrow">Roundup · Updated September 2026</p>
        <p class="card-title">Best Invoicing Software for Freelancers in 2026</p>
        <p class="card-desc">We tested seven invoicing tools on ease of use, pricing, time tracking, and automation. Here's which one belongs in your stack — and which ones to skip.</p>
        <div class="card-meta">
          <span class="meta-tag">Invoicing</span>
          <span class="meta-tag">Comparison</span>
          <span class="meta-date">Sep 2026</span>
        </div>
        <span class="card-arrow">Read the comparison →</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/freshbooks-review/" class="article-card">
        <p class="card-eyebrow">In-depth review · Updated September 2026</p>
        <p class="card-title">FreshBooks Review 2026: Honest Pros, Cons, and Pricing for Freelancers</p>
        <p class="card-desc">FreshBooks has the cleanest invoicing interface in the category and time tracking built into every plan. One catch: the Lite plan limits you to 5 clients. Here's the full breakdown.</p>
        <div class="card-meta">
          <span class="meta-tag">FreshBooks</span>
          <span class="meta-tag">In-depth review</span>
          <span class="meta-date">Sep 2026</span>
        </div>
        <span class="card-arrow">Read the review →</span>
      </a>

    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="about-strip">
    <p>StackGuide publishes independent software reviews. We may earn a commission if you buy through our links — at no extra cost to you. <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">See our affiliate disclosure.</a></p>
  </div>

</main>
</body>
</html>
